    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期辅助人：Kitty ChaCha</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：水果月饼 Asu</span></p><span></span><p><span>#本期全剧透</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们请来了两位和二郎神血战梅山的朋友，一起围绕机制、地图、Boss设计等内容，结合各自的游戏体验，聊聊今年暑假的收官作品《黑神话：悟空》，并真诚的发问“你的猴瘾治好了吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们将向您传递以下信息：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 你喜欢《黑神话》吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 地图引导真的很差吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 水果月饼老师的地图指引受难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 哪张地图的设计让你爱上？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 你也手贱打“石子”了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 你最讨厌哪张图？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">52:38</a> 你最爱的Boss是哪位老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> Asu控诉二郎神老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3977">1:06:17</a> Kitty爱死晦月魔君</span></p><span></span><p><span>分割线（后面为故事内容的讨论）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4425">1:13:45</a> 你喜欢哪个NPC或者角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4660">1:17:40</a> “黑”神话为什么不用Dark，要用Black？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5209">1:26:49</a> Kitty爱惨的“赛博奸佞”戌狗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5645">1:34:05</a> 你最喜欢哪个影神图故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6355">1:45:55</a> 你最爱哪一章主线故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6738">1:52:18</a> 王灵官值得拿出来好好夸一下！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6895">1:54:55</a> 火焰山故事里，用“家庭”困住老牛的东方思维。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7392">2:03:12</a> 最终之战你的感觉如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>西游记——张卫健</span></p><span></span><p><span>云宫迅音——《黑神话：悟空 OST》</span></p>]]></description>
